      "prompt": "Make a pie chart of gross by rating. Click any cell inside the data, open the **Insert** tab, and click **Chart**. (If the panel is already open, just click its **Chart** tab.) Set Chart type to Pie, Slices to Rating, Values to Gross ($M), Summarize by to Sum.",
